   "from_schema": 2,
   "harm": "Toggling external_signer flag on an existing wallet leaves descriptor ScriptPubKeyMans out of sync, causing wallet operations like display address and send to fail until reloaded.",
   "hash": "8eb1c655e574fb7f",
   "history": [
    {
     "at": "2026-09-18T03:49:52+00:00",
     "blocking": false,
     "by": "run:20260918-0314",
     "cause": "rc:3857009395",
     "status": "resolved"
    },
    {
     "at": "2026-10-23T01:18:23+00:00",
     "by": "run:20261023-0115",
     "cause": "rc:3863277995",
     "clears_with": "change",
     "status": "fixed",
     "type": "objection"
    }
   ],
   "id": "rc:3857009395",
   "kind": "correctness",
   "other_replies": [],
   "part": 1,
   "pin": null,
   "question": "",
   "quote": "The SPKM subclass is chosen when it's constructed, and toggling doesn't rebuild the existing ones, so after unloadwallet/loadwallet, with nothing else changed, both work.",
   "request": "",
   "status": "fixed",
   "status_by": {
    "at": "2026-08-26",
    "by": "Sjors",
    "id": "rc:3863277995",
    "quote": "it's actually easier to just have the RPC automatically reload the whole wallet for this flag. So I went with that."
   },
   "status_note": "reloading the wallet on toggle keeps SPKMs in sync; no further objection",
   "type": "objection",
   "url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/33112#discussion_r3857009395"
  },
  {
   "association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
   "at": "2026-08-25",
   "author": "jeanpablojp",
   "author_replies": [
    "rc:3863278741"
   ],
   "clears_with": "change",
   "fix": {
    "at": null,
    "sha": "ac6c932e1012940d0814249330c10a1ea560225f"
   },
   "from_schema": 2,
   "harm": "Toggling external_signer flag off leaves leftover external signer SPKMs, causing subsequent spends to abort in FillPSBT without a reload.",
   "hash": "171cc95f18b6a3ec",
   "history": [
    {
     "at": "2026-10-23T01:18:23+00:00",
     "by": "run:20261023-0115",
     "cause": "rc:3857009403",
     "clears_with": "change",
     "status": "fixed",
     "type": "objection"
    }
   ],
   "id": "rc:3857009403",
   "kind": "correctness",
   "other_replies": [],
   "part": 1,
   "pin": null,
   "question": "",
   "quote": "Imported a descriptor with the flag on, turned the flag off, imported another one, and without reloading I can't spend from either.",
   "request": "",
   "status": "fixed",
   "status_by": {
    "at": "2026-08-26",
    "by": "Sjors",
    "id": "rc:3863278741",
    "quote": "That should be fixed now, thanks to the reload."
   },
   "status_note": "fixed by the automatic reload on flag toggle",
   "type": "objection",
   "url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/33112#discussion_r3857009403"
  },
  {
   "association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
